Vnum            18
Name            dream girl~
ShortDesc       美麗女子~
LongDesc        美麗女子(dream girl)
~
Description
她的神色淒苦﹐不知受了什麼哀屈。
~
Sentinel        Yes
NoKill          Yes
NoSummon        Yes
Effect          'invis'
Alignment       0
Level           50
Hitroll         0
Protect         -1
Damroll         0
Str             100
Int             100
Wis             100
Dex             100
Con             100
Hp              -1
Mana            -1
Move            -1
Class           CLASS_MAGE
Gold            -1
Multipile       100
Migrate         0
Sex             SEX_FEMALE

Process
Type            rand_prog
Chance          30
Text
if rand(10)
  shiver
endif
~
End

Process
Type            give_prog
Argument        ice left~
Text
mpclean obj
if isnpc($n)
  break
endif
if isimmort($n)
  break
endif
if isquest($n) == 'dream_soul_broken'
  break
endif
if isquest($n) == 'dream_soul_ok'
  mpsetquest $n 'dream_soul_broken'
  break
endif
if class($n) != CLASS_GENERAL
  if class($n) != CLASS_BRAVO
    mpsetquest $n 'dream_soul_broken'
    break
  endif
endif
if isquest($n) != 'dream_soul_26'
  tell $n 對不起﹐這對我來說完全沒有幫助﹐你請回吧﹗
  sorry $n
  mpsetquest $n 'dream_soul_broken'
  mptransfer $n 501
  break
endif
tell $n 謝謝你了﹐這看來可以治好我的病﹗
emote 將冰殘(ice left)吃了下去。
tell $n 你救了我﹐你會獲得你該得的﹗
smile $n
mpoload 408
give book $n
mpadd $n firman 10
mpecho $6你感到全身再度疲憊﹐又昏昏沈沈睡去﹐醒來已經不在原地了﹗$0
mpecho 你身上又多了幾張免死金牌…
echo $6讓我們恭禧$n$6得到夢魂七絕﹗$0
mpsetquest $n 'dream_soul_ok'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_1'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_2'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_3'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_4'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_5'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_6'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_7'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_8'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_9'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_10'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_11'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_12'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_13'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_14'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_15'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_16'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_17'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_18'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_19'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_20'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_21'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_22'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_23'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_24'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_25'
mpremquest $n 'dream_soul_26'
mptransfer $n 501
~
End

End
